        <item>
            <title>0.1.27</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 18:34:55 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/linmi/mose/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>28</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.27</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Mose 0.1.27

**New**
- A welcome tour on first launch: meet your mouse's buttons, allow Accessibility (the parts that need it carry a lock), try the gesture button and pick a few settings. Settings › About › Welcome tour shows it again.
- Deutsch and 한국어.

**Improved**
- Settings are grouped by what you're doing (General, Battery, Buttons, Updates, Data, About), and each option's explanation is shown right under it.
- The download opens on an install window: drag Mose to Applications.

Requires macOS 15 or later.
]]></description>
